How many times will "Kotlin" be printed by this code?

```kotlin
fun main(args : Array) {
    for(i in 1..5){
        if(i == 5){
            break
        }
        println("Kotlin")
    }
}
```

You can also use the break and continue keywords in a range/for loop:
- *break*: Exits the current loop and continues with the code after the loop block.
- *continue*: Skips the current iteration of the loop and proceeds to the next iteration.

